                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c7d5a281-349a-338f-8796-3f1e20d0f7a1",
                        "entry_id": "cba71bca-2309-328a-af73-e9edf5d8ee63",
                        "glosses": [
                            "alleen maar voorouders hebben die tot hetzelfde ras behoren"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "65ad8098-5c4c-41a8-a482-c58449e8c284",
                                "sense_id": "c7d5a281-349a-338f-8796-3f1e20d0f7a1",
                                "text": "‘Dat is voor een groot stuk een kwestie van racisme: die bruine barbaren uit het zuiden vormen een bedreiging voor de raszuiverheid en de rust van de blanken in de VS. En het komt de Amerikaanse regering natuurlijk ook goed uit om een denkbeeldige vijand te hebben. Dan kun je de mensen makkelijker onder de knoet houden en een harder beleid voeren.’"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "bce76999-a97b-40c6-bbdc-5fc97561ebaf",
                                "sense_id": "c7d5a281-349a-338f-8796-3f1e20d0f7a1",
                                "text": "Cynthia is een van de weinige raszuivere fokkers van Duitse konijnen in Nederland. Deze konijnensoort is het grootste konijnenras ter wereld en worden voor 100 tot 150 euro verkocht. Ze zijn net wat groter dan de Vlaamse reus, die voor 25 euro de deur uit gaan. ,,De dieren worden officieel niet in Nederland erkend\", weet Anita Schothorst van de Vlaamse Reuzen Club, die ook van de 'aanslag' heeft gehoord. ,,Het is dan ook een heel eigen wereldje.\""
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e9e3bd39-9189-41db-b10a-f82c82c7dc61",
                        "source_entry_id": "cba71bca-2309-328a-af73-e9edf5d8ee63",
                        "source_sense_id": "c7d5a281-349a-338f-8796-3f1e20d0f7a1",
                        "source_sense_description": "alleen maar voorouders hebben die tot hetzelfde rasbehoren",
                        "target_lang_word": "true-bred",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "true-bred",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "94f3ebe3-e6e4-3d07-9855-9d9d023e5e6d",
                                        "entry_id": "6be293b5-fe6e-31fb-962a-f0597a216b3b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Purebred; genetically pure."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "502bb8be-c536-4d06-9803-dd3f8678fc2b",
                                                "sense_id": "94f3ebe3-e6e4-3d07-9855-9d9d023e5e6d",
                                                "text": "The issue of a wife is unlawful seed; And none's legitimate, but mongrel breed. Thou, and thy branches, have quite cross'd the strain, We ne'er shall see a true-bred whelp again."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "70daeb16-86a7-4fd1-b91a-9c00e7c0fac2",
                                                "sense_id": "94f3ebe3-e6e4-3d07-9855-9d9d023e5e6d",
                                                "text": "The Henny strain never breeds a long-tailed cock unless crossed. The contrary has been stated by many persons, but the mistake has arisen from various birds which have not been true-bred Henny, but only the product of some cross; such will, of course, breed both kinds of plumage, but the true-bred Henny never does."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2beef0bf-9e05-4d4f-9502-5c712ba3eb3c",
                                                "sense_id": "94f3ebe3-e6e4-3d07-9855-9d9d023e5e6d",
                                                "text": "Notwithstanding, there is no reason why a toy English bulldog should not be accomplished; but, equally, there is no reason why the true-bred French bulldog should not be preserved in its integrity, and recognised as such by the Kennel Club."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "58998cae-8981-32ac-86a4-0a133857de8a",
                                        "entry_id": "6be293b5-fe6e-31fb-962a-f0597a216b3b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Genuine."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "63ef026f-9447-43e0-a5f5-5033cede0d6e",
                                                "sense_id": "58998cae-8981-32ac-86a4-0a133857de8a",
                                                "text": "Well, for two of them, I know them to be as true-bred cowards as ever turn'd back; and for the third, if he fight longer than he sees reason, I 'll forswear arms."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "da530dd5-f7c9-4bc1-af5a-7ec877475be6",
                                                "sense_id": "58998cae-8981-32ac-86a4-0a133857de8a",
                                                "text": "But there are some covetous rigid persons, whose souls hold no sympathy with those of the innocent Anglers, having either got to be lords of royalties, or owners of lands adjoining to rivers, and these do, by some apted clownish nature and education for the purpose, insult and domineer over the innocent angler, beating him, breaking his Rod, or at least taking it from him, and sometimes imprisoning his person as if he were a Felon: Whereas a true-bred Gentleman scorns those spider-like attempts, and will rather refresh a civil stranger at his Table, than warn him coming on his ground upon so innocent an occasion."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "18f95909-ac2d-48cc-8c5d-e03b721119b6",
                                                "sense_id": "58998cae-8981-32ac-86a4-0a133857de8a",
                                                "text": "It's all that, lad, the eyes of twenty white men never having been laid on it; still, twenty true-bred frontiersmen—hunters and trappers, and scouts, and the like,—can do a deal of mischief if they try."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d8a1000e-150d-348c-b94a-295b0a0e4cb7",
                                        "entry_id": "6be293b5-fe6e-31fb-962a-f0597a216b3b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of a proper lineage."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "21442729-ac98-4282-8a0b-c06d1cbf3faf",
                                                "sense_id": "d8a1000e-150d-348c-b94a-295b0a0e4cb7",
                                                "text": "Come all ye true-bred Irishmen, a story I will tell Concerning bold McCarthy who in Liverpool did dwell."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "15785c80-a664-4444-9f03-c3565a04ff04",
                                                "sense_id": "d8a1000e-150d-348c-b94a-295b0a0e4cb7",
                                                "text": "Why, she is the image of Papa! A true Lacey! Don't you think so? A very true-bred heir, my darling!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "211ec72d-9f5a-49bd-adea-ea5fa66e8326",
                                                "sense_id": "d8a1000e-150d-348c-b94a-295b0a0e4cb7",
                                                "text": "'I don't know why for sure,' she says. 'But I suppose, if I was Henry's mother, I would not want my child, a pretender, a usurper, king only by right of battle, taking his crown alongside a princess, a true-bred princess of the royal family, beloved of the people, and a beauty. Apart from anything else I would not like how it looked.'"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6aa9a55f-8f45-34d0-8603-1e7469077630",
                                        "entry_id": "6be293b5-fe6e-31fb-962a-f0597a216b3b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Inborn."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3a3a39ee-5af2-4d2f-a977-acbbe621babf",
                                                "sense_id": "6aa9a55f-8f45-34d0-8603-1e7469077630",
                                                "text": "Experience, I grant, he probably lacks ; but he has the true-bred instinct."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
